{"h":3390,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.048758812288267395,"c":1,"w":0.31394500732421876,"t":"@MirsIELTS","x":-0.0012465319262224739,"y":-0.002170447112146201},{"h":0.013096830204876508,"c":1,"w":0.059548257191975873,"t":"Test 1","y":0.047965116556656917,"x":0.8521560561099375},{"c":1,"h":0.016444182044285216,"x":0.080013057295990966,"w":0.7023991902669271,"y":0.092239601231256629,"t":"I know that one or two of our visitors may not be all that mobile. The main entrance to the"},{"y":0.10813568732040491,"t":"house has a lot of steps so you might want to use the disabled entry. This is on the far side of","x":0.080027153128276227,"h":0.016118002922485664,"c":1,"w":0.73934697469075517},{"y":0.12645348810428736,"h":0.013081395872222901,"c":1,"t":"the house from the car park.","x":0.078028748216422555,"w":0.2279260762532552},{"w":0.72689936319986981,"t":"Children will probably be most interested in the adventure playground. That's at the northern","x":0.08008214580915099,"y":0.14825581368986041,"h":0.013101118644781806,"c":1},{"h":0.016895318945600479,"x":0.077967319964832402,"y":0.16235362609429083,"c":1,"w":0.73317479451497392,"t":"end of the larger lake, in a bend on the path that leads to the lake. There's lots for children to"},{"x":0.079740318850837752,"h":0.011962457392419745,"y":0.18009164170753,"c":1,"w":0.074733276367187504,"t":"do there."},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"w":0.72279261271158857,"c":1,"t":"There are a number of lovely gardens near the house. The kitchen gardens are rectangular","y":0.20203488392577063,"x":0.078028744986560331},{"y":0.21799410003035002,"c":1,"t":"and surrounded by a wall. They're to the north-east of the house, quite near the smaller lake.","h":0.014564039292237041,"w":0.73511291503906251,"x":0.078028758022205699},{"c":1,"x":0.080005732538273977,"h":0.017171199764825618,"y":0.23220000180425138,"w":0.55043528238932304,"t":"They're still in use and have a great collection of fruit and vegetables."},{"w":0.71047225952148441,"h":0.01459662457131361,"c":1,"t":"The Temple of the Four Winds is a bit more of a walk - but it's worth it. Take the path from","y":0.25575221241794699,"x":0.078028757574684748},{"t":"the car park and go past the western sides of the stables and the house. Then when the path","h":0.013274336283185972,"c":1,"y":0.2716814157293983,"w":0.73511291503906251,"x":0.080082146167687732},{"t":"forks, take the right-hand path. Go up there with the woods on your left and the temple is right","x":0.078028758296629808,"y":0.28779069788073208,"w":0.74332646687825521,"h":0.014569184069788244,"c":1},{"y":0.30377906997236481,"t":"at the end. There are great views over the whole area.","w":0.43326487223307297,"x":0.078028754730235766,"c":1,"h":0.014534883302221635},{"x":0.077862863130570711,"w":0.13585538228352867,"c":1,"h":0.017463790983577088,"t":"OK, so that's ...","y":0.32629717425671956},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.84188911660330668,"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079822,"y":0.1104651165415419,"t":"Q17"},{"t":"Q18","x":0.84188911659764487,"y":0.14970930258564885,"w":0.039014374415079822,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1},{"x":0.841889116591228,"w":0.039014374415079822,"h":0.013081394746943587,"y":0.20494186072758847,"c":1,"t":"Q19"},{"w":0.039014374415079822,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"t":"Q20","x":0.84188911659764487,"y":0.27325581421355583},{"t":"PART 3","y":0.38363333844058078,"w":0.10477588653564453,"c":1,"x":0.0780021999143969,"h":0.016163555359066772},{"x":0.080053691991800693,"h":0.0088765799823412594,"t":"COLIN:","w":0.047284812927246109,"y":0.41561984952353903,"c":1},{"y":0.42978241970848674,"h":0.01252818374858844,"x":0.077832382732917482,"t":"MARIE:","w":0.051727431615193692,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.08006838176445262,"h":0.010238579944171655,"y":0.44618884953954119,"t":"COLIN:","w":0.047255433400471988},{"t":"MARIE:","w":0.051334702173868832,"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"x":0.078028747452000988,"y":0.47674418583168854},{"x":0.079781349656059888,"w":0.047829491297403978,"t":"COLIN:","y":0.50765985803609215,"h":0.0093895869972431267,"c":1},{"t":"MARIE:","x":0.078028747821096089,"y":0.52180232571882468,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"w":0.049281314214070615},{"w":0.047227926254272454,"c":1,"x":0.080082135769167659,"y":0.55377906956175382,"t":"COLIN:","h":0.010174418761666915},{"h":0.0089945604667551748,"c":1,"y":0.58561899881600177,"w":0.047327292760213205,"t":"MARIE:","x":0.080032452084751834},{"y":0.60029069749416653,"x":0.080082135702432555,"w":0.047227926254272468,"t":"COLIN:","c":1,"h":0.010174418761666915},{"y":0.66133720943975505,"w":0.051334702173868832,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"MARIE:","x":0.07802874786070417},{"c":1,"t":"COLIN:","x":0.077961665856027818,"y":0.69316990908588938,"w":0.049415477116902667,"h":0.011915995730059636},{"y":0.72375040105595545,"h":0.01180152330426687,"w":0.051412661870320661,"c":1,"t":"MARIE:","x":0.077989767760031095},{"w":0.049281314214070629,"t":"COLIN:","y":0.75581395338774593,"x":0.078028747312212973,"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1},{"y":0.77016786164229167,"w":0.051496035257975262,"h":0.011989857946525295,"c":1,"t":"MARIE:","x":0.077948081066808297},{"t":"COLIN:","y":0.83284883720162284,"w":0.047227926254272468,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"x":0.080082135332822713,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907316944963,"w":0.047227926254272454,"c":1,"t":"MARIE:","x":0.080082135567495619,"y":0.84738372067707568},{"x":0.080082135337489493,"t":"COLIN:","y":0.87936046510954347,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"w":0.047227926254272454,"c":1},{"h":0.013274336283185861,"y":0.41268436581564727,"w":0.27104723612467446,"c":1,"t":"I haven't seen you for a bit, Marie.","x":0.17453798347186084},{"t":"No. I've been busy with my project.","x":0.17453799003058112,"y":0.42877906950079381,"h":0.013108836373748378,"c":1,"w":0.27720738728841149},{"x":0.17453797530556206,"w":0.61396306355794272,"t":"You're making a vegan alternative to eggs, aren't you? Something that doesn't","h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"y":0.4433139536952877},{"w":0.17078643798828125,"h":0.012737438460718509,"c":1,"y":0.45918150413859671,"t":"use animal products?","x":0.17642227763929236},{"c":1,"h":0.014749262536873142,"t":"Yes. I'm using chickpeas. I had two main aims when I first started looking for an","w":0.62217661539713542,"x":0.17453797561071685,"y":0.47374631281128388},{"y":0.48982558151002409,"c":1,"h":0.016074123776416149,"w":0.63244354248046875,"x":0.17453798225250741,"t":"alternative to eggs, but actually I've found chickpeas have got more advantages."},{"t":"Right.","x":0.17453798754926661,"w":0.049281314214070643,"h":0.013081394746943587,"y":0.50581395375817273,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371857499684,"y":0.52034883732071957,"w":0.62012318929036447,"c":1,"t":"But how about your project on reusing waste food - you were looking at bread,","x":0.17453799471142267},{"x":0.17659137585487863,"y":0.53628318603589398,"h":0.013274336283185861,"w":0.10266940434773766,"c":1,"t":"weren't you?"},{"c":1,"h":0.014749262536873253,"x":0.17453799317039626,"y":0.55073746310670313,"t":"Yes. It's been hard work, but I've enjoyed it. The basic process was quite","w":0.57084187825520827},{"c":1,"h":0.019077652112572507,"t":"straightforward - breaking the stale bread down to a paste then reforming it.","x":0.17443297496869264,"y":0.56533201336824945,"w":0.59567769368489576},{"h":0.016828985973797006,"c":1,"t":"But you were using 3-D printing, weren't you, to make the paste into biscuits?","y":0.58136498007264514,"w":0.60586771647135418,"x":0.17448795819052834},{"y":0.59662210471360377,"w":0.58743387858072915,"h":0.017550426246845663,"c":1,"x":0.17446117987129003,"t":"Yeah, I'd used that before, but in this project, I had time to play around with"},{"y":0.61327433635842332,"w":0.63244354248046875,"c":1,"h":0.013274336283185861,"t":"different patterns for the biscuits and finding how I could add fruit and vegetables","x":0.17453798229467318},{"w":0.58726898193359367,"h":0.013117411003000345,"c":1,"x":0.17453799354316041,"y":0.6293604648519906,"t":"to make them a more appetising colour, and I was really pleased with what"},{"w":0.18275154113769532,"h":0.013081395872222901,"x":0.17453798708606233,"y":0.64534883692837219,"c":1,"t":"I managed to produce."},{"w":0.60985626220703126,"c":1,"t":"It must've been a great feeling to make something appetising out of bits of old","h":0.014536598790711674,"x":0.17453798794458475,"y":0.65988200564733124},{"c":1,"y":0.67581120951392226,"x":0.17453799366741254,"t":"bread that would've been thrown away otherwise.","w":0.39219711303710947,"h":0.013274336283185861},{"t":"It was. And I'm hoping that some of the restaurants in town will be interested in","x":0.17446685656858904,"w":0.61819869995117183,"h":0.016274776852588047,"y":0.68925386102857245,"c":1},{"t":"the biscuits. I'm going to send them some samples.","y":0.70584910232777776,"c":1,"h":0.016482934417274553,"x":0.17441332356306996,"w":0.40681159973144532},{"w":0.63449691772460937,"c":1,"x":0.1745379886672789,"t":"I came across something on the internet yesterday that might interest you. It was","y":0.72238372113708937,"h":0.014534883302221635},{"w":0.53398518880208334,"t":"a company that's developed touch-sensitive sensors for food labels.","y":0.73653205650218356,"h":0.015201394747843766,"c":1,"x":0.17652475499005826},{"w":0.059548250834147137,"y":0.75290697693612119,"c":1,"t":"Mmm?","h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.17453798982933297},{"x":0.17453797640885141,"w":0.63860371907552083,"c":1,"t":"It's a special sort of label on the food package. When the label's smooth, the food","y":0.76744186047965779,"h":0.017513891799611603},{"x":0.17450640648974533,"w":0.61609283447265617,"t":"is fresh and then when you can feel bumps on the label, that means the food's","h":0.014506760318722334,"y":0.78321227697092055,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.17453798894347727,"y":0.79941002966593377,"h":0.014543458494113315,"w":0.64271046956380207,"t":"gone bad. It started off as a project to help visually impaired people know whether"},{"x":0.17659137550959783,"c":1,"w":0.1950718688964844,"h":0.011799410029498469,"t":"food was fit to eat or not.","y":0.81533923305833234},{"y":0.82994186066639575,"w":0.24024640401204428,"x":0.17453798888720173,"t":"Interesting. So just solid food?","h":0.014600912448579306,"c":1},{"w":0.63860371907552083,"t":"No, things like milk and juice as well. But actually, I thought it might be really good","h":0.014541743568262877,"x":0.17659136417920326,"c":1,"y":0.84593023276514956},{"h":0.013081395872223012,"x":0.17453799250417365,"c":1,"w":0.35523612976074215,"y":0.86191860438540735,"t":"for drug storage in hospitals and pharmacies."},{"y":0.87640117987274502,"t":"Right. And coming back to food, maybe it'd be possible to use it for other things","x":0.17659136365193548,"h":0.016040680471774649,"c":1,"w":0.62217661539713542},{"y":0.89233038326901271,"t":"besides freshness. Like how many kilograms a joint of meat is, for example.","h":0.013274336283185861,"w":0.59548253377278648,"x":0.17453799379431265,"c":1},{"h":0.013298354247326616,"w":0.065793965657552134,"y":0.59872872983019942,"c":1,"x":0.841846343560951,"t":"Q21\/22"},{"h":0.013184497349381874,"x":0.84186870722359197,"y":0.65983216990725069,"w":0.065749238332112547,"t":"Q21\/22","c":1},{"w":0.065708421071370426,"c":1,"t":"Q23\/24","x":0.84188911585035175,"y":0.84738372120937688,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"y":0.89389534900734213,"t":"Q23\/24","w":0.06365502675374346,"c":1,"x":0.84394250754715283},{"x":0.87474332604323002,"w":0.039014374415079822,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"t":"101","y":0.92296511653913726},{"h":0.04166666666666663,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","y":0.94166666659226195,"w":0.45294118245442705,"c":1,"x":0.51176470218665204}]}